Install the NoLiveArea plugin?	要安装 NoLiveArea 插件吗?
Keeps the LiveArea out of sight:\n- Turning the Vita on: VitaXMB opens by itself, no LiveArea.\n- Starting a game: the screen stays black while it loads.\n- Closing a game: VitaXMB opens again.\nPressing the PS button in a game still shows the LiveArea.	让 LiveArea 不再出现:\n- 开启 Vita 时:VitaXMB 自动打开,不显示 LiveArea。\n- 启动游戏时:加载期间屏幕保持黑色。\n- 退出游戏时:VitaXMB 会再次打开。\n在游戏中按 PS 按钮仍会显示 LiveArea。
VitaXMB was updated and replaced the NoLiveArea plugin.\nNew: if VitaXMB is ever uninstalled while the plugin\nstays, it no longer tries to open it on every app\nyou close. It works again once VitaXMB is back.\nThe old version stays loaded until the Vita restarts.\nRestart now to load the new version.	VitaXMB 已更新并替换了 NoLiveArea 插件。\n新增:若 VitaXMB 被卸载而插件仍保留,\n插件不会再在每次关闭应用时尝试打开它。\nVitaXMB 回来后便会再次运行。\n旧版本会保持加载,直到 Vita 重新启动。\n请立即重新启动以加载新版本。
